      "difficulty": "advanced",
      "instruction": "A paid generation was submitted and the app was restarted while the upstream task was still running. On restart the stored taskId is read back, the same upstream task is polled to terminal SUCCESS, and the remote temp URL becomes a durable local artifact that is re-read from the media store. A second paid submission after restart is the hard-gate failure this task exists to catch.",
