      "runnerScopeReason": "Deterministic certification: the restart boundary is produced offline by eval/capture/restart-resume.mjs, which drives the real workspace seam through two process lifetimes (submit -> durable taskId -> restart -> task.resume on the SAME taskId) with a fake deterministic provider and a real on-disk media store, then writes a realCapture-shaped capture this runner grades. Deterministic runners cannot express a process restart inside one world, so they are not evidence here.",
